# No Cursor git attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, `Made with Cursor`, or any Cursor/cursoragent trailer to commits or PRs.
- Never use `git commit --trailer` for Cursor attribution.
- If a commit message would include Cursor co-author text, strip it before committing.
- Do not reintroduce Cursor as a GitHub contributor on this repository.
